[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=59 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="从登记室回来，你始终捏着那张临时凭条。纸边被汗浸软，名字的位置还是一条横线。德雷顿试过两次叫你，都被自己嘴里那个没出口的称呼绊住。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "maury", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="喂，来玩牌吗？不是叫你“喂”。我的意思是，要不要过来坐？你这么站着，我老觉得自己忘了给客人拿凳子。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "maury", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她把一摞牌推开，腾出桌角。牌面是手画的船、灯塔和鱼，几张牌的边沿发黑，像曾经被放在炉子旁烤过。莫里已经回来了，正拿布擦头发。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "maury", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="只玩一把，我等会儿还要回航灯那边。输了的替大家把衣服上的线头收了。先声明，不包括拉姆森那件工作服，那已经是线头穿着衣服。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "maury", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="别碰我的衣服。抽屉里有一卷坏绳，输的人帮我拆出还能用的细股。我明天要绑零件，不是拿来扎人的。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "maury", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我不记得自己会不会。要是一直输，你们会觉得扫兴吗？我现在连坐下来之后该把手放哪儿，都要看别人一眼。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "maury", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="这游戏最扫兴的是赢了以后讲自己怎么赢。你只要别学帕金斯，我们就能一直邀请你。牌给我，我带你看一遍。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "maury", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="帕金斯正坐在窗下补账，听见自己的名字，只把铅笔叼起来，空出两只手。德雷顿叹了口气，看来她们原本没准备给自己增加这么难缠的对手。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "maury", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="我只讲过一次。你们把同一张黑帆连着抽回去四遍，还觉得它是自己回来的。我实在很难不说话。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="德雷顿在桌上摆出一对灯塔，把它们压到一边。然后是一对鱼，也被拿走。最后只剩一张涂着黑帆的小船，船身歪得像要从纸上滑下来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="同样的凑一对就放下，轮着抽旁边的人。最后谁留下黑帆，谁去拆绳。没了，就这些，剩下全靠你看起来有多镇定。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="那张黑帆有折角。要是一直能认出来，大家就不会去抽，谁一开始拿到，最后大概还是在谁手里。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="我早说该重画。上次德雷顿说那是风浪留下的痕迹，一艘船有点经历很好。现在让她给所有牌都补一点经历。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="德雷顿拿起黑帆，在桌沿轻轻掰直，折痕反而更明显了。你们安静地看着她。她把牌一张张收回去，找了块布，蒙在抽牌那个人眼前。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="改成盲抽。谁也别偷偷从指头缝看，尤其是莫里。你上次用这一招猜饼干，被店主追过半条码头。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="那叫识别包装，不叫作弊。店主追我是因为你替我报了两倍的价。我就吃了一块，你把他整罐都借出来看。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你把临时凭条折好，放到碗下面，再接过发来的牌。手指自然地把同样的图案靠在一起，理成一小扇。动作快得让你自己也停了一下。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="会拿牌，不一定会玩。前几天我见过一个把牌摊得特别漂亮的人，输了还问我，鱼为什么不能跟灯塔算一对。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_18"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我知道它们不能算。但如果这两张灯塔，一张顶上点灯，一张没点呢？我以为差别会有用，可你们没有分开它们。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_19"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="墨不够了，没画完。你要是想分白天夜里，我可以给你一支笔。先说明，改规则的人得自己洗牌。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_20"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="第一轮你就抽到了黑帆。即便蒙着眼，手也立刻认出了折痕。你努力不看它，莫里反而笑起来，像一眼看出了你把什么秘密藏在脸上。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_21"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="别这么认真，越认真越像捧着一枚没拔保险的东西。把它插回去，混在别的牌里。我又不能隔着你的手看见画。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_22"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她抽走了你最左边的牌，是一条鱼。德雷顿紧跟着抽了一张，凑成灯塔，得意地敲桌子。桌面晃了晃，帕金斯及时把水杯从桌沿移开。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_23"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="你看，运气也是一种本事。我的本事就是需要的时候有一点，不需要的时候留给下次。你别一直盯着我笑，我会紧张。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_24"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="你刚才把抽来的牌放在最右边，有配对就立刻拿掉。莫里抽不到你藏的那张，因为她每次都先摸中间。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_25"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="莫里的手还没缩回来。她把抽到的牌翻过来看看，又看看你。德雷顿先把手里的牌一股脑合拢，重新排开，像把门前的脚印全扫掉。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_26"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="你一直在数？我还以为你只顾着怕抽到黑帆。那你猜猜，现在它到了谁手里，说错的人再加一段绳。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_27"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="还在我这里。我只是能看见你们抽牌的习惯，没办法让自己抽到想要的。我连你手里还剩几张都差点数错。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_28"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="德雷顿笑得把蒙眼布掉在膝上。拉姆森从维修单后抬头，拿走自己抽到的一对鱼，把剩下的一张举到桌子中间，宣布她已经可以去倒热水了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_29"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="最后一张。谁先来？别在我头顶开会，我的水再等一会儿就凉了。黑帆不在我这里，我没那么好的表情。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_30"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你碰到她的牌，忽然想起一个很模糊的触感：有人把纸牌塞在你的掌心，手很小，笑声隔着一扇门。你收回手，桌边的笑声也跟着远了一点。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_31"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="怎么了，额头又疼？把牌放下，我去叫医生。别为了这点坏绳硬撑，我们本来就是找个借口坐一会儿。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_32"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="不是疼。刚才好像有人和我玩过，也可能只是我想出来的。我看不见那个人，只记得手，比我的小很多。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_33"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="莫里捋头发的动作慢下来。帕金斯把账本合上，没有拿笔。你本来已经准备回答一串问题，她们却在等你自己决定，接下来还说不说。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_34"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="没有别的了。那个人是站着还是坐着，我都不清楚。我只是突然很想把手里这张给他，好像他一直等着抽。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_35"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="那这张先留着。不是黑帆，我画的那对鱼尾巴不一样，你拿走这张也不会有人认错。少一对，我们照样能玩。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_36"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="不用。现在拿走，我下次看见它，也许就只记得是你给的了。我想先把这一把玩完，别让大家等我太久。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_37"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="拉姆森没有再劝，把牌重新举起来。你伸手抽走，和手里那张鱼放成一对。德雷顿在旁边小小地拍了两下手，像替一个刚学会走路的人庆祝。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_38"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="你别拍，他现在比你剩得少。轮到你了，把布蒙好。我先把牌搓匀，免得有人说我又只放在中间。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_39"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她这次特意交换了两边的位置。德雷顿伸出手，停在最左边，又挪到右边，犹豫得大家都不说话了。你忽然发现自己也在等那根手指落下。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_40"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我想问一件不相干的事。以前你们在船上，也总这样玩吗？我是说，没有刚捞起来的人，没有需要补的笔录的时候。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_41"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="没你说得那么整齐。有时候我们连桌子都腾不出来，有时候德雷顿吵着要玩，我只想睡觉。今天她是怕你又回去盯着那张纸。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_42"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="你能不能等我把牌抽完再拆台？我蒙着眼也听得见。还有，我是真的想玩，不全是为别人，你别把我说得那么好。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_43"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她抽中了黑帆。布一揭开，整个人都垮下来。莫里把最后一对鱼往桌上一扣，忍了半天的笑终于冒出来；拉姆森把坏绳放在德雷顿旁边，轻轻拍了拍。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_44"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="细股拆出来别乱扔，我拿网袋给你。你要是拆着拆着睡了，就放在桌边，明天我自己接着做，不收利息。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_45"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你拿起绳子另一端，想帮她松开一个缠死的结。德雷顿伸手拦住，却发现你的手指已经绕进绳股中，轻轻一挑，把结口翻了出来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_46"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="你怎么什么都……算了，刚才那句不算。我差点又把你当成一只捞上来就能用的工具箱。能不能教我？这回我真不会。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_47"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我也说不上来。你把这边按住，别跟着拉。对，就这里。剩下的我慢慢做，你看第二次，大概就能学会。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_48"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="弗莱彻回来时，你们已经把细绳绕出一小团。她在门口站了一会儿，问有没有留下一点热水。帕金斯把杯子递过去，说还热，别再拿去擦图。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_49"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="我就用过一次，那张图泡得要散架了。你们继续，我把借来的灯送回去。这边够亮吗？不够就先别拆了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "lamson", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_50"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你抬头望向那盏灯，突然叫住她。话到了嘴边才发现，自己没有什么正经事要问，只是很想知道她会不会像刚才那样，回头等你说完。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "lamson", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_51"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="如果我明天还是想不起名字，你们要怎么叫我？总不能每次先想一会儿，然后假装只是要问我喝不喝水。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "lamson", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_52"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="德雷顿捏着绳端，没有马上接。莫里想了想，报了一个非常难听的外号，立刻被另外三个人否掉。弗莱彻把灯放下，拉过一把凳子。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "lamson", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_53"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="那就一起想。可别急着今晚定下来，不满意还能换。我们队有个人以前被叫了半个月的漏斗，你可以问她后来怎么样了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "lamson", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_54"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="后来队长连续一周只能吃到没盐的汤。还有，这段不许写进日志。我不希望以后每个来借东西的人都先看我的帽子。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "lamson", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_55"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你们又笑起来。名字最后还是没取成，热水也渐渐凉了。你把那张临时凭条收好，手里留下的不是纸边的湿意，而是一小团刚拆开的、毛茸茸的绳。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "lamson", "maury"])

actor_tones={}

